cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Solstica Kalendaro
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file.
  To cite the calendar proposal itself, cite the document listed under
  references.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Plaza Alonso
    given-names: Javier
    orcid: https://orcid.org/0009-0009-3908-3759
repository-code: https://github.com/j-plaza1/solstica-kalendaro-app
abstract: >-
  Android application showing the Gregorian calendar and the Solstica Kalendaro
  side by side, with a bidirectional date converter and the seasonal structure
  of the proposed calendar. It is an interactive view of the foundations set
  out in the proposal document listed under references.
keywords:
  - calendar
  - calendar reform
  - solar calendar
  - solstice
  - .NET MAUI
  - Android
license: MIT
references:
  - type: report
    title: >-
      Solstica Kalendaro: a proposal for a regular, solstice-anchored calendar
      faithful to the real lengths of the seasons
    authors:
      - family-names: Plaza Alonso
        given-names: Javier
        orcid: https://orcid.org/0009-0009-3908-3759
    doi: 10.5281/zenodo.22129891
    license: CC-BY-4.0
